  journal   = "Cell",
  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  abstract  = "Cellular functions depend on numerous protein-coding and
               noncoding RNAs and the RNA-binding proteins associated with them,
               which form ribonucleoprotein complexes (RNPs). Mutations that
               disrupt either the RNA or protein components of RNPs or the
